    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might wonder: \u201cWhat could be difficult about renting apartments?\u201d Well, all you need to do is collect money from tenants every month, buy new apartments, rent them, develop your business... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/2b6bffed9d50e918d264dc7bb67dfa83.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/2b6bffed9d50e918d264dc7bb67dfa83.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/2b6bffed9d50e918d264dc7bb67dfa83.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy, right? Actually, no, as there is something standing in the way of your happiness: the tenants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a day will go by without them providing you with entertainment! Late payments or refusal to pay are the norm here, not to mention extreme behavior in the form of attacks on your esteemed person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you, as the landlord, have a rich arsenal of resources and tools. So don't be indebted to your tenants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/811a886c9d604cea044ab711f246e520.avif?t=1747745999\" width=670 height=74 /></span>Use your wits or force in the situations with problematic tenants. You can wait to collect payment or evict a tenant, but be careful! Tenants protect access to their homes. Therefore, sometimes you will have to use other means, e.g. call the police, climb through a window, or call a friend who can pick locks\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/d49333c4db43aed9a6ea4a0d0ecc3b55.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/d49333c4db43aed9a6ea4a0d0ecc3b55.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/d49333c4db43aed9a6ea4a0d0ecc3b55.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/19a4e55cecffc4da610a6d1bf33d83ce.avif?t=1747745999\" width=670 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new districts with completely new apartments waiting to be purchased and then rented! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/7996c05a17e529038bd2878e6ab0b83e.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/7996c05a17e529038bd2878e6ab0b83e.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/7996c05a17e529038bd2878e6ab0b83e.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Of course, new places mean new people with a whole lot of new problems\u2026 for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, carefully select tenants for the apartments you intend to rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/ac641914b1ef09f14bae258bbf10c688.avif?t=1747745999\" width=670 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/adf0bac1eca0d9d8b741a145f3375aa7.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/adf0bac1eca0d9d8b741a145f3375aa7.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/adf0bac1eca0d9d8b741a145f3375aa7.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your apartments are your source of income, so equip them with new furniture and appliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After saying goodbye to the tenant, clean up the place yourself or with the help of a cleaning team, and find all the damages so that the insurer will refund your money! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, damages are not the only surprises that former tenants tend to leave behind\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/b872f14e5d17600b5606dcd063d16755.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/b872f14e5d17600b5606dcd063d16755.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/b872f14e5d17600b5606dcd063d16755.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might wonder: \u201cWhat could be difficult about renting apartments?\u201d Well, all you need to do is collect money from tenants every month, buy new apartments, rent them, develop your business... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/2b6bffed9d50e918d264dc7bb67dfa83.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/2b6bffed9d50e918d264dc7bb67dfa83.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/2b6bffed9d50e918d264dc7bb67dfa83.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sounds easy, right? Actually, no, as there is something standing in the way of your happiness: the tenants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not a day will go by without them providing you with entertainment! Late payments or refusal to pay are the norm here, not to mention extreme behavior in the form of attacks on your esteemed person!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But you, as the landlord, have a rich arsenal of resources and tools. So don't be indebted to your tenants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/811a886c9d604cea044ab711f246e520.avif?t=1747745999\" width=670 height=74 /></span>Use your wits or force in the situations with problematic tenants. You can wait to collect payment or evict a tenant, but be careful! Tenants protect access to their homes. Therefore, sometimes you will have to use other means, e.g. call the police, climb through a window, or call a friend who can pick locks\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/d49333c4db43aed9a6ea4a0d0ecc3b55.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=616 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/d49333c4db43aed9a6ea4a0d0ecc3b55.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/d49333c4db43aed9a6ea4a0d0ecc3b55.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/19a4e55cecffc4da610a6d1bf33d83ce.avif?t=1747745999\" width=670 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new districts with completely new apartments waiting to be purchased and then rented! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/7996c05a17e529038bd2878e6ab0b83e.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=616 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/7996c05a17e529038bd2878e6ab0b83e.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/7996c05a17e529038bd2878e6ab0b83e.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Of course, new places mean new people with a whole lot of new problems\u2026 for you! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Therefore, carefully select tenants for the apartments you intend to rent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/ac641914b1ef09f14bae258bbf10c688.avif?t=1747745999\" width=670 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/adf0bac1eca0d9d8b741a145f3375aa7.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=614 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/adf0bac1eca0d9d8b741a145f3375aa7.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/adf0bac1eca0d9d8b741a145f3375aa7.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your apartments are your source of income, so equip them with new furniture and appliances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After saying goodbye to the tenant, clean up the place yourself or with the help of a cleaning team, and find all the damages so that the insurer will refund your money! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, damages are not the only surprises that former tenants tend to leave behind\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/b872f14e5d17600b5606dcd063d16755.poster.avif?t=1747745999\" width=616 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/b872f14e5d17600b5606dcd063d16755.webm?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3640840/extras/b872f14e5d17600b5606dcd063d16755.mp4?t=1747745999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Ordinary people, ordinary problems, and among them you - the landlord who rents apartments to them... And unfortunately, these ordinary people\u2019s\u00a0 problems automatically become your problems! Rent apartments, collect rent money, and be prepared! The life of a landlord won\u2019t be easy!",
